# Aether Syphon: "{2}, {T}: Draw a card." and "Max speed — Whenever you draw a card, each opponent mills two cards." Cast on
# turn 1 it gives Bot1 speed 1 (CR 704.5aa, 702.179a); a Lightning Bolt to Bot2's face on each of turns 1, 3 and 5 raises it
# once a turn: 2, 3, 4 (CR 702.179d). On turn 3, at speed 3, the {2},{T} draw mills nothing (the card does not have the
# trigger below max speed, CR 702.178a); on turn 5, at speed 4, the same draw mills Bot2's top two (CR 701.17a: library 11 to 9), and only
# that: Bot2's own draw on turn 6 is not "you draw" (CR 109.5), so Bot2's library goes down by one card only.

